 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">NBN</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"243\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Associated malignant tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 292.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"390\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Leukaemias, lymphomas, solid tumours including colorectal cancer, sarcomas and other solid tumours</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.1pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"243\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Associated benign tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 292.3pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"390\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">None reported</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"243\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cancer-related inheritance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 292.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"390\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Autosomal recessive</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.1pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"243\">\r